      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Turns out, there is a new setting for that.\n\nHowever, I doubt translations of content should be on by default. This might cause so many confusions and give a false immersion that tech support/feedback is actually multilingual.\n\nIs there a way to instead \"show original\" use \"translate\" button or smth, like on twitter?",
