  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "feedback.vrchat.com is enforced in machine-translated Russian language. It cannot be configured or turned off.\n\nWorst part - it translates original messages of users with not so good quality. \n\nI thought it's MS Edge messing with me, but things are the same in clean Firefox. Turns out translations are part of Canny and sent from the server - the pages are sent translated, as well as api responses.",
